<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have stepped up patrols and warning shots along the Myanmar border after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre in a border village and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting a temporary closure of unofficial trade. The Myanmar military warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU, while the KNU warned Thailand against supporting rival forces. Japan is providing aid to 3,300 women and girls displaced by border clashes, and Malaysia approved a new train line extension to the Thai border. Myanmar refugees are filling labor gaps in Thailand as Cambodians return home, and Cambodia has made waiting villages permanent amid the stalemate. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPTE5JVnFMcE9IaUZMRlRMTXkwczhPeFdkTGpfcDhFNElyTl91RDkteVNMcTVQcXhGbmFxQWtqTFI3NnplamwtZk1xWk96Z0FBbnJpV21BdHlGS1lMbGlCOUluTTZVeDBZOWV3WDlFaElVbGNPa2MzUDBnYlk3ekVROHdJN21sMk9URHRVWjMzUnA0YXJwaXAyRFdxRnJ2d1BGakxV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNbm5NUnJpb1REYzg1d3lFVDRFV1pjRC1QbGtid3AtTVIweUctOWQxNGRGZndxeE9kSkFRWmVxNjgzUTFnUVhMUXFwUUFQWnR0TXhsN1BXeWxTMF92UXhoaEdFWm5GVV9TWENOaGttYXJrek5xSWI0dU5LZzFSLWhUeEVQTTdUQWNo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPOEF1WEhoQ3BsTTZRQUpodXc2NnJBNTRqLWpWcnpPcXI3c3YtZE05NkFGRjVwMllLOXRMZGk2dnJ4VnJ